PHOTOS

  Unsplash
    The stock photos in this repository are from Unsplash, under the
    Unsplash License (https://unsplash.com/license):
      - apps/docs/public/landing/img/p-faisal.webp, p-khalid.webp and
        p-noura.webp: the portraits on the landing page.
      - apps/docs/public/landing/img/f-dunes.webp: the AlUla dunes behind
        the Arabic word on the landing page.
      - apps/docs/public/samples/avatar-portrait.png: the sample portrait in
        the Avatar docs and the Storybook stories.
    The repository does not record the photographer of any of these five
    photos; see TO CONFIRM.

  Wall of Love testimonials
    apps/docs/public/landing/img/wall/*: one photo and 13 company logos,
    copied from the testimonials smicolon.com publishes. These are the
    customers' own pictures, not stock photos.

  Landing film
    apps/docs/public/landing/media/*: the Fasla product film and its posters,
    in English and Arabic.

